      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n1) $2\\cdot(x-18.2)=7.6$\uff1b\n2) $(y-6.15):2=4.9$\uff1b\n3) $3\\cdot(x-12.6)=8.1$\uff1b\n4) $(z-4.81):3=3.89$.",
